    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in a small, quiet and peaceful residential estate, this spacious detached home offers\r\ngenerous accommodation, excellent outdoor space and a welcoming setting ideally suited to family\r\nliving.\r\n\r\nThe property opens into a bright entrance hall and features a comfortable lounge with a bay window\r\nand attractive solid wood flooring. The well-appointed accommodation includes a kitchen-dining\r\nroom area with separate utility room, three generously proportioned bedrooms, two with ensuite\r\nfacilities, and a family bathroom with a full-size bath and overhead power shower.\r\n\r\nThe upstairs master bedroom is particularly inviting, featuring warm semi-solid wood flooring, its\r\nown ensuite and access to a spacious walk-in dressing room. This room was originally configured as a\r\nfourth bedroom and could potentially be converted back.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from a dual heating system, comprising a pellet stove with back boiler and an\r\noil-fired heating system, providing flexibility in heating the home.\r\n\r\nThe footprint of this property on the site has potential for development or addition, subject to\r\nplanning.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a cobble lock driveway and well maintained front garden. To the\r\nrear a generous private garden with paved patio area provides an ideal space for outdoor dining,\r\nentertaining or simply enjoying the peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nA 3m x 3m Shanette garden shed provides excellent additional storage.\r\n\r\nLocated within a quiet and established residential estate, this attractive detached family home\r\ncombines generous living accommodation, privacy, outdoor space and flexibility, making it an\r\nappealing choice for family living."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious detached residence\r\n4 bedrooms\r\n2 ensuite bedrooms\r\nPotential for a self-contained granny flat, subject to the necessary planning requirements\r\nDual heating: wood pellet stove and oil\r\nSpacious garden\r\nPaved patio area\r\n3m x 3m Shanette garden shed\r\nExternal Tap & Outdoor socket for all your outdoor living needs\r\nBER: C\r\nBER Certificate No. 119692051"
      },
